      ],
      "en": "My heart is steadfast, God. I will sing and I will make music with my soul.",
      "ko": "하나님이여 내 마음을 정하였사오니 내가 노래하며 내 심령으로 찬양하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "8db495b3d44b7ecfb8771990b42f720e7d3ebaeafc8d9cd09c31cfcd7bbacd95",
      "translation_text_hash": "7fd1276b95637e8d64e315cfb1c5d3e0e0e6ffdd995265ef086b78241c056fe5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
