        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 108,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "God has spoken from his sanctuary: “In triumph, I will divide Shechem, and measure out the valley of Succoth.",
      "ko": "하나님이 그 거룩하심으로 말씀하시되 내가 뛰놀리라 내가 세겜을 나누며 숙곳 골짜기를 척량하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "43a0406ba1c4e0f734a48b255aaeb0feeb1d61068c27bfef7876d851aebb4b54",
      "translation_text_hash": "265e2dbf85e5d36d370b35f15d0146ff5c04afd91923f9d18c47ab150e72eb27",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님이 그 거룩하심으로 말씀하시되 내가 뛰놀리라 내가 세겜을 나누며 숙곳 골짜기를 척량하리라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "265e2dbf85e5d36d370b35f15d0146ff5c04afd91923f9d18c47ab150e72eb27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:108:8",
      "sequence": 15751,
